I reached the large railway station at eight in the morning.
There was a lot of crowd there.
Many people were carrying their luggage.
I checked my ticket.
My train was on platform number five.
I quickly went towards the platform.
The train for Lonavala was already standing there.
I boarded the train.
Now I had to find my seat.
My seat was near the window.
But a man was sitting there.
I said to him, "Excuse me, this is my seat."
He checked his ticket.
His seat was just nearby.
He went to his seat.
Then I put my backpack on my seat.
I sat down comfortably near the window.
Now I was ready for the trip to Lonavala.
